<title>USA: Hvide Marine Q4 shr $0.28 vs $0.11.</title>
<headline>Hvide Marine Q4 shr $0.28 vs $0.11.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q4 Ended Dec. 31	     Year Ended Dec. 31</p>
<p>		     1996	  1995	     1996	  1995</p>
