<p>		11,355,718   3,778,842	6,644,963   3,778,842</p>
<p>Notes:</p>
<p>(1)  EBITDA is defined as net income from continuing operations before interest expense, income tax expense, depreciation expense, amortization expense, minority interest and other non-operating income.  </p>
